# no-silent-truncation watchlist: the repo's own, seeded once by astra and never overwritten.
# Starts with the personal-data search tools and sqlite over the macOS protected stores
# (low false-positive: each only fires where the tool exists). Add this repo's own data
# searches below, e.g. "grep && 05_DocsFromPortal".
#
# One substring per line; ' && ' means all parts must be present. # comments, blanks ignored.
mailq
notesq
shotq
imsgq
callq
recall
convoq
triage_ledger
sqlite3 && chat.db
sqlite3 && Envelope Index
sqlite3 && CallHistory
sqlite3 && NoteStore
sqlite3 && AddressBook
